{"id":"cac-bai-toan-dac-trung-cua-vong-lap-in-hinh-dem-so","chapterId":"chuong-2","chapterNumber":2,"chapterTitle":"ĐIỀU KHIỂN LUỒNG","order":1,"lessonNumber":1,"title":"Các bài toán đặc trưng của vòng lặp (In hình, đếm số)","wordCount":187,"estimatedMinutes":3,"headings":[{"level":2,"text":"1. Dạng bài in hình (Pattern Printing)","id":"1-dang-bai-in-hinh-pattern-printing"},{"level":3,"text":"Ví dụ: in hình tam giác vuông cân với n dòng","id":"vi-du-in-hinh-tam-giac-vuong-can-voi-n-dong"},{"level":3,"text":"Ví dụ: in tam giác cân (dạng kim tự tháp)","id":"vi-du-in-tam-giac-can-dang-kim-tu-thap"},{"level":2,"text":"2. Dạng bài đếm số (Counting)","id":"2-dang-bai-dem-so-counting"},{"level":3,"text":"Ví dụ: đếm số lượng ước của n","id":"vi-du-dem-so-luong-uoc-cua-n"},{"level":3,"text":"Ví dụ: đếm số nguyên tố trong đoạn [1,n] (dạng cơ bản)","id":"vi-du-dem-so-nguyen-to-trong-doan-1-n-dang-co-ban"},{"level":3,"text":"Ví dụ: đếm chữ số của một số nguyên n","id":"vi-du-dem-chu-so-cua-mot-so-nguyen-n"},{"level":2,"text":"Mẹo tối ưu","id":"meo-toi-uu"}],"contentHtml":"<h2 id=\"1-dang-bai-in-hinh-pattern-printing\">1. Dạng bài in hình (Pattern Printing)</h2>\n<p>Dùng <strong>vòng lặp lồng nhau</strong>: vòng ngoài chạy theo hàng, vòng trong chạy theo cột/ký tự cần in.</p>\n<h3 id=\"vi-du-in-hinh-tam-giac-vuong-can-voi-n-dong\">Ví dụ: in hình tam giác vuông cân với <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> dòng</h3>\n<code>*\n**\n***\n****\n</code><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;=</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>        cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"*\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span>    cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h3 id=\"vi-du-in-tam-giac-can-dang-kim-tu-thap\">Ví dụ: in tam giác cân (dạng kim tự tháp)</h3>\n<code>  *\n ***\n*****\n</code><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;=</span> n <span class=\"tk tk-t\">-</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\" \"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">2</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">*</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">-</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"*\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><p><strong>Mẹo chung:</strong> số ký tự ở dòng <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span> thường là một hàm của <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span> — hãy viết ra vài dòng đầu bằng tay, tìm quy luật <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> rồi mới code.</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-dang-bai-dem-so-counting\">2. Dạng bài đếm số (Counting)</h2>\n<p>Dùng <strong>một biến đếm</strong>, duyệt qua dãy/khoảng số và tăng biến đếm khi thỏa điều kiện.</p>\n<h3 id=\"vi-du-dem-so-luong-uoc-cua-n\">Ví dụ: đếm số lượng ước của <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></h3>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>count</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{count} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} [\\,n \\bmod i = 0\\,]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 2.9291em; vertical-align: -1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top: -1.8723em; margin-left: 0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top: -4.3em; margin-left: 0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 1.2777em;\"></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> count <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>n <span class=\"tk tk-t\">%</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">==</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> count<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h3 id=\"vi-du-dem-so-nguyen-to-trong-doan-1-n-dang-co-ban\">Ví dụ: đếm số nguyên tố trong đoạn <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1, n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span> (dạng cơ bản)</h3><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> count <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">bool</span> isPrime <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">true</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">*</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;=</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">%</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">==</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span> isPrime <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">false</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">break</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>isPrime<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> count<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">8</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h3 id=\"vi-du-dem-chu-so-cua-mot-so-nguyen-n\">Ví dụ: đếm chữ số của một số nguyên <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></h3>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>o</mtext><mo>ˆ</mo></mover><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>&nbsp;chữ&nbsp;s</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>o</mtext><mo>ˆ</mo></mover><mo>ˊ</mo></mover></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{số chữ số} = \\lfloor \\log_{10} n \\rfloor + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top: -3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top: -3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">o</span></span><span style=\"top: -3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left: -0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left: -0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;chữ&nbsp;s</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top: -3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top: -3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">o</span></span><span style=\"top: -3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left: -0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left: -0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right: 0.01389em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.207em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.4559em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.2441em;\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> count <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">while</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>n <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    n <span class=\"tk tk-t\">/=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">10</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    count<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"meo-toi-uu\">Mẹo tối ưu</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Khi kiểm tra ước số / số nguyên tố, chỉ cần duyệt đến <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"kat